{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SmWt6imcPoPPkBo88wQN7D","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tschema_version: 1\n3\tkind: decision\n4\tid: ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\n5\tstatus: accepted\n6\towner: example-fixture\n7\trationale: 'The fixture follows the blueprint order: schema, effective policy, request 101 enforcement,\n8\t  then visible reason and decision telemetry.'\n9\t---\n10\t# ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\n11\t\n12\tStatus: **accepted**\n13\t\n14\tOwner: example-fixture\n15\t\n16\t## Rationale\n17\t\n18\tThe fixture follows the blueprint order: schema, effective policy, request 101 enforcement, then visible reason and decision telemetry.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ceeea8b2-285a-465b-b497-8dff44bb5f61","uuid":"4cac5d7a-f174-47bc-b00a-a379c6d61a78","timestamp":"2026-09-14T22:07:12.140Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat _zzwi1h9/tasks/.plans/rate-limit/decisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md","content":"---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: decision\nid: ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\nstatus: accepted\nowner: example-fixture\nrationale: 'The fixture follows the blueprint order: schema, effective policy, request 101 enforcement,\n  then visible reason and decision telemetry.'\n---\n# ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\n\nStatus: **accepted**\n\nOwner: example-fixture\n\n## Rationale\n\nThe fixture follows the blueprint order: schema, effective policy, request 101 enforcement, then visible reason and decision telemetry.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}}}
