 Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology.\ndecompose compile | Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves.\ndecompose status | Explain planning blockers and next valid action.\ndecompose impact | Compare leaf projections to identify affected authorizations.\ndecompose import | Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required.\nrecipe list | List available pinned strategies.\nrecipe show | Show resolved guidance.\nrecipe validate | Validate a resolved recipe.\nsetup decompose | Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime.\nreceipt operational | Validate or import operational evidence without upgrading its trust.\nmesh init | Use the existing TaskMesh init operation.\nmesh doctor | Use the existing TaskMesh doctor operation.\nmesh serve | Use the existing TaskMesh serve operation.\nmesh frontier | Use the existing TaskMesh frontier operation.\nmesh run | Use the existing TaskMesh run operation.\nmesh status | Use the existing TaskMesh status operation.\nmesh watch | Use the existing TaskMesh watch operation.\nmesh explain | Use the existing TaskMesh explain operation.\nmesh cancel | Use the existing TaskMesh cancel operation.\nmesh resume | Use the existing TaskMesh resume operation.\nmesh accept | Use the existing TaskMesh accept operation.\nmesh finish | Use the existing TaskMesh finish operation.\nmesh adapters | Use the existing TaskMesh adapters operation.\nmesh setup | Use the existing TaskMesh setup operation.\nmesh mcp | Use the existing TaskMesh mcp operation.\nexample task-plan | Write the installed task-plan example; existing output requires explicit --force.\nexample intent | Write the installed intent example; existing output requires explicit --force.\nexample recipe | Write the installed recipe example; existing output requires explicit --force.\nexample incident | Write the installed incident example; existing output requires explicit --force.\nexample release-evidence | Write the installed release-evi